 in which a main character has a humorous name. <br>\n<br>\n(Source: CAPSULE Blog: Total Color List Production Committee)<br>\n<br>\n<i>There is a lot of speculation if this movie was in fact ever released. It was screened several times at a movie company, but it is said that even the author, Shimokawa, was not satisfied with the work due to the sloppy movement. There is however, no evidence that it actually released in theaters. The name of the work does not exist in the list of theater screenings in Magazine \"Kinema record\" or \"Movie Review\" for Janurary 1917. Also since there is so few materials that mention this film and no copy has ever been found, the contents of the story are completely unknown. <br><br>Some even speculate that was released at a later date in 1917 under a different name.</i><br><br>","duration":5,"endDate":{"day":null,"month":1,"year":1917},"episodes":1,"externalLinks":[],"genres":["Comedy"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":46,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[],"relations":[],"season":null,"seasonYear":null,"source":"ORIGINAL","startDate":{"day":null,"month":1,"year":1917},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":12,"score":10},{"amount":9,"score":20},{"amount":12,"score":30},{"amount":19,"score":40},{"amount":41,"score":50},{"amount":21,"score":60},{"amount":14,"score":70},{"amount":6,"score":80},{"amount":1,"score":90},{"amount":5,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":3,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":109,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":222,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":53,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":17,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"FINISHED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[],"synonyms":["The Story of the Concierge Mukuzo Imokawa","Imokawa Mukozo the Doorman","芋川椋三玄関番の巻","Gatekeeper Imokawa Muzozo","いもかわむくぞうげんかんばんのまき"],"title":{"english":null,"native":"芋川椋三玄関番之巻","romaji":"Imokawa Mukuzo-san Genkanban no Maki"},"trailer":null,"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793624319},"17389":{"al":17389,"bannerImage"